                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On August 24, 1954, during a period of political crisis in Brazil, President
                        Vargas committed suicide, and Vice
                    President João Café Filho succeeded to
                    the Presidency. Documentation concerning these events and the United States
                    reaction is in files 732.00 and 732.11 for 1954.</p>
            </div>
